  "loopBody": "If a client systematically rejects distributors with a certain coverage or channel, the system records that signal and adjusts future recommendations. Value does not depend only on an external generative model, but on structured data, business rules, user feedback and a dedicated Spain–GCC taxonomy.",
  "metricsTitle": "What we measure",
  "metric1": "Time from sign-up to first qualified shortlist",
  "metric2": "Validated partners per client",
  "metric3": "Contact-to-meeting rate",
  "metric4": "Meeting-to-opportunity rate",
  "metric5": "Pipeline value generated",
  "metric6": "Exports attributable when the client confirms the deal",
  "adviceNote": "Ameerix does not guarantee sales or regulatory approval. Legal, tax, customs and certification questions are referred to official sources or qualified professionals.",
  "techPageTitle": "Technology designed to be explained.",
  "techPageBody": "A cloud-native, modular architecture in which every score can be traced, every data point has a source and AI is used where it adds value.",
  "archTitle": "Architecture",
  "archBody": "The web application connects to an application API, a relational database, a search engine, a scoring layer and AI services, hosted with a European cloud region.",
  "archLayer1": "Web application",
  "archLayer2": "Application API",
  "archLayer3": "Scoring layer",
  "archLayer4": "Search engine",
  "archLayer5": "Relational database & Trade Graph",
  "archLayer6": "AI services (abstraction layer)",
  "scoringTitle": "Scoring methodology",
  "scoringBody": "Deterministic, rule-based scoring over structured data with documented weights. Two users with the same inputs get the same result, and every change is audited. Each score shows the factors that raise or lower it.",
  "aiTitle": "Responsible use of AI",
  "aiBody": "Language models are used through external providers behind Ameerix's own abstraction layer, so providers can be replaced. Sensitive data is minimised and is not used to train third-party models where provider terms do not allow it.",
  "aiPoint1": "Outputs are recommendations, not binding decisions",
  "aiPoint2": "Scoring-engine versions and logs are kept to explain changes",
  "aiPoint3": "Users are informed when they interact with an automated assistant",
  "aiPoint4": "Hallucination controls: sources, rules and human review",
  "aiPoint5": "No decisions on employment, credit or other high-risk categories",
  "dataPrinciplesTitle": "Data principles",
  "dp1Title": "Minimisation",
  "dp1Body": "Collect only what is needed to deliver the service.",
  "dp2Title": "Traceability",
  "dp2Body": "Record the source and update date of relevant commercial data.",
  "dp3Title": "Segregation",
  "dp3Body": "Keep client data, partner data and analytics data separate.",
  "dp4Title": "Retention",
  "dp4Body": "Defined retention periods and deletion procedures.",
  "dp5Title": "Access control",
  "dp5Body": "Roles, MFA for staff and logging of administrative actions.",
  "securityTitle": "Security",
  "sec1": "Encryption in transit and at rest",
  "sec2": "Automated backups and restore testing",
  "sec3": "Vulnerability and dependency management",
  "sec4": "External security review before scaling",
  "sec5": "Incident response and notification plan",
  "complianceTitle": "Regulation",
  "complianceBody": "Designed around the GDPR and the EU AI Act. Ameerix mainly processes company data and professional contact data, documenting purposes, legal bases, retention periods and data-subject rights.",
  "progressTitle": "Progressive innovation",
  "progressBody": "The MVP uses rule-based scoring and structured data. Proprietary machine-learning components are trained or tuned only when the volume of real cases justifies it, keeping every technical claim verifiable.",
  "aboutEyebrow": "About Ameerix",
  "aboutTitle": "Turning export ambition into structured decisions.",
  "aboutBody": "Ameerix Market Intelligence is a B2B SaaS platform for market intelligence and internationalisation that helps Spanish SMEs evaluate, prioritise and execute their commercial entry into the Gulf Cooperation Council countries.",
  "visionTitle": "Vision",
  "visionBody": "Make structured market intelligence accessible to SMEs that cannot maintain large export teams — starting with the Spain–GCC corridor.",
  "missionTitle": "Mission",
  "missionBody": "Convert a fragmented internationalisation process into a digital system that diagnoses, prioritises, finds partners and keeps execution on track, with explainable and traceable recommendations.",
  "whyExistTitle": "Why we exist",
  "whyExistBody": "Many Spanish SMEs have the product and the ambition to export, yet entering the GCC remains split across sources, directories, consultants and spreadsheets. Ameerix exists to reduce that coordination cost and accelerate the commercial decision.",
  "spainTitle": "Spain & Europe",
  "spainBody": "Ameerix is being established as a Spanish limited company (S.L.) headquartered in Barcelona. Structural product, engineering and operations roles are created in Spain, and the technological core and intellectual property remain with the Spanish company. The Gulf is the target market, not the place where the core is relocated.",
  "spainPoint1": "Headquartered in Barcelona",
  "spainPoint2": "European cloud region and data-processing agreements",
  "spainPoint3": "Built around the GDPR and the EU AI Act",
  "spainPoint4": "Contributing to SME internationalisation, skilled employment and local intellectual property",
  "cultureTitle": "Product culture",
  "cult1": "Measure before automating.",
  "cult2": "Explain the why behind every score.",
  "cult3": "Remove outdated data, even if the database looks smaller.",
  "cult4": "Listen to clients without turning every request into development.",
  "cult5": "Document decisions and model changes.",
  "roadmapTitle": "Roadmap",
  "roadmapBody": "A phased plan in which every expansion is conditioned on evidence.",
